{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "cloud-knights-against-the-borisin",
  "name": "Cloud Knights Against the borisin",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Cloud_Knights_Against_the_borisin",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-12T09:01:05.289Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(spoken)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The general saw a poor, helpless orphan. Outside the city, the borisin forces laid siege to the city. The general stopped and asked the boy a question."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"Boy, why aren't you running for your life? You can't blame heaven and earth if you just wait for the borisin to come and kill you!\""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The orphan did not grow timid in the presence of the general, but as soon as he opened his mouth, tears were running down his face."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(sung)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "My good general! Disease and swords were at our doorstep."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "My mother and I escaped to another planet."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "She passed on as we wandered around, homeless and wretched."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "How could my heart not be filled with sorrow!"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The general cried as he heard the orphan's tale."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "How could one bear to see my family so miserable!?"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I will cut down the evil monsters by the sacred order."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Who can endure such loneliness?"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(spoken)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The general charged onto the borisin ship. Thousands of monsters appeared along the bridge. The general looked at his foes and grinned. He thought to himself:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(sung)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I will put an end to all our future troubles"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "to be settled with the Plagues Author!"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(spoken)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I saw him shout as the qi moved from his Well. There is a saying that goes —"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(sung)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The general shouted on the bridge."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "He shouted so loudly that even the comets reversed their tracks."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Reignbow Arbiter gifted me a longsword"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "to cut off your head and break your chains."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The day I come to the Hall of Karma,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I shall have nothing to hold on to for this life!"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
